00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:39.060
they haven't been purified yet one of
the biggest issues about lemon juice is

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:43.199
that it contains phototoxic
chemicals these are called psoralens

00:04:43.199 --> 00:04:48.720
which are a subset of furanocoumarins or
furocoumarins these chemicals are

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:53.039
found in many citrus peels including
lemon and lime if you're squeezing a

00:04:53.039 --> 00:04:56.550
lemon at home you can't really separate
the juice from these phototoxic

00:04:56.550 --> 00:05:01.860
components these furanocoumarins are also
found in parsnips celery parsley and

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:06.750
figs the problem is that when they're on
your skin they react with UV to cause

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:11.400
something called phytophotodermatitis
in other words a skin reaction caused by

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:16.169
plants when it interacts with sunlight
the symptoms are red skin and horrific

00:05:16.169 --> 00:05:20.760
blistering that develops over the next
48 hours after light exposure there's

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:24.510
going to be some really gross blisters
coming up so look away now if you're

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:26.780
squeamish

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:36.100
it's over the blisters are gone oh it's
okay it's okay

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:41.150
it's not entirely clear what the exact
mechanism of how these chemicals cause

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:45.470
this massive blistering on your skin
either they react with DNA to form

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:49.490
cross links or they interact with
proteins in your skin which causes your

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:54.380
keratinocytes or skin cells to die and
your membrane start rupturing the

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:58.340
overall process leads to damaged cell
membranes which results in cell death

00:05:58.340 --> 00:06:04.190
edema which is swelling blistering and
injury to your skin after this reaction

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:07.849
you might get post inflammatory
hyperpigmentation which is pigmentation

00:06:07.849 --> 00:06:12.560
after damage and this can take months to
heal in proper skin care products a lot

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:16.460
of the time the citrus essential oils
have been processed to remove these

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:26.990
